<BaseLayout title="The SEC Examination from 2027: A Parent's Guide | A-Worthy" description="From 2027 the O-Level becomes the SEC, and JC admission moves from L1R5 ≤ 20 to L1R4 ≤ 16. What changes for today's Sec 3 students, from MOE and SEAB sources." ogImage="/images/og-blog.png">
